  "design_note": "T2a-T2d's underlying per-(event,kernel) values never depend on the threshold variant. Variant enters only through which events are members of a segment bucket (segment/anchor availability is variant-dependent). T2e therefore tests population-membership sensitivity, not independent recomputation -- see module docstring.",
